WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.429
Safety management gets messy fast,

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:06.830
whether you're managing a single facility or juggling multiple sites.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:10.383
A report comes in, an action item gets assigned,

00:00:10.423 --> 00:00:13.950
and someone has to chase down whether it actually got done.

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:17.821
Between the initial report, the follow-up, and the eventual fix,

00:00:17.861 --> 00:00:20.300
critical details slip through the cracks.

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:23.920
Reldro ties all of that work together in one place.

00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:28.863
When an issue pops up, your team gets instant visibility into what happened,

00:00:28.903 --> 00:00:31.970
what needs to be done, and who's on the hook to fix it.

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:35.659
If a major incident occurs, the entire response,

00:00:35.699 --> 00:00:39.520
from the investigation and debrief to the corrective actions,

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:42.179
is linked directly to the original record.

00:00:42.219 --> 00:00:46.104
You can easily trace the root cause, see what needs to change,

00:00:46.144 --> 00:00:48.510
and verify that the fix was completed.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:52.682
It handles your everyday safety operations the same way.

00:00:52.722 --> 00:00:56.266
Audits, certifications, inspections, and routine debriefs

00:00:56.306 --> 00:00:59.850
live in a single hub, giving you a live, accurate picture

00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:02.240
of what's finished and what's overdue.

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:07.131
Instead of forcing your team to fill out another passive spreadsheet,

00:01:07.171 --> 00:01:11.433
Reldro keeps your safety operations connected, clear, and accountable,

00:01:11.473 --> 00:01:13.830
across a single site or multiple sites.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:17.050
Because safety isn't about logging data.

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:20.327
It's about making sure the work actually gets done.

00:01:20.367 --> 00:01:21.677
Stop chasing updates.

00:01:21.717 --> 00:01:24.440
Connect your safety operations with Reldro.

